[agent] I will now complete the task using the Hopsworks Python SDK. Here's the plan:
[agent] 1. Connect to Hopsworks using the provided environment variables.
[agent] 2. Create two feature groups: `rawa7b4d0b` (version 1) from `data/raw_a.csv` and `rawb7b4d0b` (version 1) from `data/raw_b.csv`, both with `row_id` as the record key.
[agent] 3. Create a derived feature group `derived7b4d0b` (version 1) with `row_id` as the record key and a single feature `col_sum` (rounded to 6 decimal places), containing only the `row_id`s present in both source tables.
[agent] 4. Ensure the derived feature group is traceable to its sources via lineage/provenance.
[agent] 5. Enable online/real-time access for the derived feature group.
